  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your obsessive study of monsters lends you uncanny insights.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Improved Monster Lore<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) on skill checks made to identify the abilities and weaknesses of creatures, and if you expend one use of mythic power you can treat the result of such a skill check as a natural 20. If you spend a standard action carefully studying a creature while making such a check, you may add an insight bonus equal to the result of your skill check divided by 10 to any one d20 roll you make against that creature before the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc45\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
